#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:35
msgid "2. Color Palette & Roles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:37
msgid "Primary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:38
msgid ""
"**Neon Volt** (`#faff69`): The signature brand color — a vivid acid "
"yellow-green that's the sole chromatic accent on the black canvas. Used "
"for primary CTAs, accent borders, link hovers, and highlighted moments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:39
msgid ""
"**Forest Green** (`#166534`): Secondary CTA color — a deep, saturated "
"green for \"Get Started\" and primary action buttons that need "
"distinction from the neon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:40
msgid ""
"**Dark Forest** (`#14572f`): A darker green variant for borders and "
"secondary accents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:42
msgid "Secondary & Accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:43
msgid ""
"**Pale Yellow** (`#f4f692`): Active/pressed state text color — a softer, "
"more muted version of Neon Volt for state feedback."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:44
msgid ""
"**Border Olive** (`#4f5100`): A dark olive-yellow for ghost button "
"borders — the neon's muted sibling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:45
msgid ""
"**Olive Dark** (`#161600`): The darkest neon-tinted color for subtle "
"brand text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:47
msgid "Surface & Background"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:48
msgid ""
"**Pure Black** (`#000000`): The primary page background — absolute black "
"for maximum contrast."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:49
msgid ""
"**Near Black** (`#141414`): Button backgrounds and slightly elevated dark"
" surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:50
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Charcoal** (`#414141`): The primary border color at 80% opacity — the "
"workhorse for card and container containment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:51
msgid ""
"**Deep Charcoal** (`#343434`): Darker border variant for subtle division "
"lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:52
msgid ""
"**Hover Gray** (`#3a3a3a`): Button hover state background — slightly "
"lighter than Near Black."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:54
msgid "Neutrals & Text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:55
msgid "**Pure White** (`#ffffff`): Primary text on dark surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:56
msgid "**Silver** (`#a0a0a0`): Secondary body text and muted content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:57
msgid "**Mid Gray** (`#585858` at 28%): Subtle gray overlay for depth effects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:58
msgid ""
"**Border Gray** (`#e5e7eb`): Light border variant (used in rare light "
"contexts)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:60
msgid "Gradient System"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:61
msgid ""
"**None in the traditional sense.** ClickHouse uses flat color blocks and "
"high-contrast borders. The \"gradient\" is the contrast itself — neon "
"yellow-green against pure black creates a visual intensity that gradients"
" would dilute."
msgstr ""

