#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:87
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:88
msgid ""
"**Weight 900 is the weapon**: The display headline uses Inter Black (900)"
" — a weight most sites never touch. Combined with 96px size, this creates"
" text with a physical, almost architectural presence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:89
msgid ""
"**Full weight spectrum**: The system uses 400, 500, 600, 700, and 900 — "
"covering the full gamut. Weight IS hierarchy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:90
msgid ""
"**Uppercase with maximum tracking**: Section overlines use 1.4px letter-"
"spacing — wider than most systems — creating bold structural labels that "
"stand out against the dense dark background."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:91
msgid ""
"**Dual sans-serif**: Inter handles display and body; Basier handles "
"feature section headings at 600 weight. This creates a subtle personality"
" shift between \"data/performance\" (Inter) and \"product/feature\" "
"(Basier) contexts."
msgstr ""

