#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:216
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: ClickHouse uses shadows on a black canvas, where "
"they're barely visible — they exist more for subtle dimensionality than "
"obvious elevation. The most distinctive depth mechanism is the **inset "
"shadow** (Level 4), which creates a \"pressed into the surface\" effect "
"unique to ClickHouse. The neon border highlight (Level 5) is the primary "
"attention-getting depth mechanism."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:218
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:220
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:221
msgid ""
"Use Neon Volt (#faff69) as the sole chromatic accent — it must pop "
"against pure black"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:222
msgid ""
"Use Inter at weight 900 for hero display text — the extreme weight IS the"
" personality"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:223
msgid ""
"Keep everything on pure black (#000000) — never use dark gray as the page"
" background"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:224
msgid "Use charcoal borders (rgba(65,65,65,0.8)) for all card containment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:225
msgid ""
"Apply Forest Green (#166534) for primary CTA buttons — distinct from neon"
" for action hierarchy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:226
msgid ""
"Show performance stats as oversized display numbers — it's the core "
"visual argument"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:227
msgid "Use uppercase with wide letter-spacing (1.4px) for section labels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:228
msgid "Apply Pale Yellow (#f4f692) for active/pressed text states"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:229
msgid ""
"Link hovers should ALWAYS shift to Neon Volt — unified interactive "
"feedback"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:231
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:232
msgid ""
"Don't introduce additional colors — the palette is strictly black, neon, "
"green, and gray"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:233
msgid ""
"Don't use the neon as a background fill — it's an accent and border color"
" only (except on CTA buttons)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:234
msgid ""
"Don't reduce display weight below 700 — heavy weight is core to the "
"personality"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:235
msgid "Don't use light/white backgrounds anywhere — the entire experience is dark"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:236
msgid ""
"Don't round corners beyond 8px — the sharp geometry reflects database "
"precision"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:237
msgid ""
"Don't use soft/diffused shadows on black — they're invisible. Use border-"
"based depth instead"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:238
msgid ""
"Don't skip the inset shadow on active states — the \"pressed\" effect is "
"distinctive"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_clickhouse.md:239
msgid "Don't use warm neutrals — all grays are perfectly neutral"
msgstr ""

